# Academy accessibility

- Meet WCAG 2.2 AA as a minimum for all Academy UI.
- Complete keyboard operation; visible focus; screen-reader landmarks and headings.
- Course player must never trap focus or require drag-and-drop, precise pointer movement, colour recognition, or audio alone.
- Support captions, transcripts, audio-description fields, Easy Read variants, TTS-friendly content.
- Honour reduced motion, adjustable text spacing/contrast from AccessibilityProfile digital preferences.
- No assessment time limits by default; always save and resume; plain-language validation.
- Prefer low-bandwidth and mobile-first layouts. Accessible charts plus downloadable report equivalents.
